{"id":247,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","Crystal"],"text":"It will not stay still, even while it’s a pupa. It already has arms and legs under its solid shell."},{"games":["Sword","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"Even sealed in its shell, it can move freely. Hard and fast, it has outstanding destructive power."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"This dangerous pupa thrashes about. Its shell is as hard as bedrock, containing its gradually forming new body within."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"This troublesome Pokémon can’t wait to evolve, so it relieves its stress by wildly propelling itself around using compressed gas."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Pupitar creates a gas inside its body that it compresses and forcefully ejects to propel itself like a jet. The body is very durable—it avoids damage even if it hits solid steel."},{"games":["Y","HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"Its shell is as hard as sheet rock, and it is also very strong. Its thrashing can topple a mountain."},{"games":["X","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Its body is as hard as bedrock. By venting pressurized gas, it can launch itself like a rocket."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"This pupa flies around wildly by venting with great force the gas pressurized inside its body."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A PUPITAR creates a gas inside its body that it ejects under compression to propel itself like a jet. Its body can withstand a collision with solid steel."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Shed Skin","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon may cure its own status conditions by shedding its skin."}],"eggGroups":["Monster"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":40,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"mountain","color":"Gray","shape":"Squiggle","evolution":{"id":246,"name":"Larvitar","condition":null,"children":[{"id":247,"name":"Pupitar","condition":"Lv. 30","children":[{"id":248,"name":"Tyranitar","condition":"Lv. 55","chil